  <!-- EN: Annelitrice Tokiwano Gakuen is founded on a simple belief: nothing in life is better than being a high school student. Friendship, club activities, sports competitions, tea parties, awkward confessions, and complicated love triangles are treated as the ideal form of existence.\n\nTheir entire society is organized like a school. Every citizen is a Student and belongs to one or more clubs, which handle everything from farming and manufacturing to medicine and law enforcement. Leadership is chosen by lottery, and the winner becomes the Great Senpai, supreme leader of the Student Board.\n\nUnfortunately, Tokiwano Gakuen is far better at recreating school life than surviving. Its militias are poorly organized, defenses are neglected, and Schools are routinely looted, burned, or wiped out by hostile forces.\n\nYet nothing changes. Each generation rebuilds the School, reopens the clubs, and resumes its rivalries, romances, and tea parties as though the previous massacre had been little more than an unusually disruptive semester. -->
  <Anneli_Faction_Tokiwano.description>这里是「安妮莉特丝·常盤学园」——她建立在一个再简单不过的信念之上:人生在世,没有什么能比得上"当一名高中生"更美好的事了!友情、社团活动、体育比赛、茶话会、笨拙的告白、还有无法理清的三角恋,这些都被奉为最理想的存在形态。\n\n她们的整个社会,都是按照"学校"的样子搭建起来的。每一位公民都是"学生",都要加入一个或多个社团——从农耕、制造业,到医疗、治安维持,样样都由社团负责。领导人由抽签决定,中签者就成为"大前辈",学生会至高无上的会长。\n\n可惜呢,常盤学园擅长的,是重现校园生活,而不是"活下去"这件事。她们的民兵组织松松散散,防御工事也没人上心,各个"学校"三天两头就被敌对势力洗劫、焚毁,甚至彻底抹去。\n\n纵然如此,什么都没有改变。每一代人都会重新建起学校,重开社团,继续谈恋爱、参加比赛、开茶话会,仿佛上一场屠杀,也不过是一个格外多事的学期罢了。</Anneli_Faction_Tokiwano.description>
